{"suttaId":"tha-ap461","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[1261,1275],"vripara":"58"},"segments":{"tha-ap461:0.3":"Paṭṭipupphiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap461:1.1":"“Nīharante sarīramhi, vajjamānāsu bherisu;","tha-ap461:1.3":"Pasannacitto sumano, paṭṭipupphamapūjayiṃ [satti …(syā. pī.)].","tha-ap461:2.1":"“Satasahassito kappe, yaṃ pupphamabhipūjayiṃ;","tha-ap461:2.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, dehapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap461:3.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap461:4.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap461:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap461:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā paṭṭipupphiyo [sattipaṇṇiyo (syā. pī.)] thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap461:7.1":"Paṭṭipupphiyattherassāpadānaṃ navamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
